  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">LUMUSTprojektet mellan Mbarara och Lunds universitet har fokuserat kring kapacitetsutveckling f&#xF6;r personal och studenter p&#xE5; de tv&#xE5; universiteten, ett Mastersprogram i folkh&#xE4;lsa har p&#xE5;b&#xF6;rjats. Insatsen f&#xF6;r att utveckla en HIV-policy vid Mbararas universitet liksom HIV/AIDS kompisprojektet har lett till &#xF6;penhet kring ungdomsh&#xE4;lsa och HIV/AIDS.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The interventions for the LUMUST project have sustainable results in the areas of capacity bulding for staff and student exchange in the two universities, initiated a Masters of Public Health program through the collaboration. The Mbarara HIV policy and the peer project have led to reduced stigma and increased openness to HIV and ASRH issues. Balance 5 Million UGX approve into the phaseout workplan</narrative>
  </description>
